&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;CIfadQ75GocsZ1x6DMGljETtgPb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg5pnXkkhM3IDlbOGOOeflsg&quot;&gt;As a key digital asset hub, Singapore is an integral part of our global strategy. Licensed by the MAS, OKX SG is focused on providing Singapore users with a secure and user-friendly platform for trading digital assets. Our mission is to become the leading exchange in Singapore, offering seamless and efficient trading experiences to our clients and partners.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg5pnXkkhM3IDlbOGOOeflsg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg5pnXkkhM3IDlbOGOOeflsg&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;CIfadQ75GocsZ1x6DMGljETtgPb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OcxmdZYuroHREOx2IaPl6WpGgKe&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Business Strategy Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Singapore team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a high-impact strategy role responsible for identifying growth opportunities, solving complex business problems, and driving strategic initiatives across the Singapore business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work closely with senior leadership to shape business priorities, evaluate new opportunities, and develop data-driven recommendations that influence commercial and operational decisions. Unlike a traditional strategy role, you will also own execution, taking initiatives from initial problem definition through implementation and measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success in this role requires structured thinking, commercial acumen, intellectual curiosity, and a willingness to move seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution. You should be equally comfortable building a business case, analyzing data, developing executive-ready recommendations, and personally driving implementation without relying on large support teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQ1gdeOLNoEsm2xDroWukiwGs3g&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GEUbd7sWzobkyGxnNNAufQyQsXe&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Strategy &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data, market intelligence, and commercial insights to identify commercial growth opportunities, diagnose business challenges, and uncover operational inefficiencies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct structured analyses to quantify opportunities, validate hypotheses, and develop data-driven business cases and strategic recommendations that influence commercial priorities and long-term business growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leadership and cross-functional teams to frame complex business problems, define success metrics, and evaluate strategic opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Communication &amp;amp; Stakeholder Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex analyses into clear, compelling presentations, business cases, and commercial proposals for executive decision-making, client engagements, and strategic partnerships.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesise data from multiple sources into concise narratives that influence stakeholders, secure alignment, and drive action.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the Singapore business in cross-functional discussions, ensuring local market insights are effectively communicated and incorporated into business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Business Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own strategic initiatives end-to-end, from conceptualisation and planning through implementation and measurable business outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional execution by aligning stakeholders, removing blockers, and driving initiatives to completion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve business processes through automation, AI-enabled tools, and scalable operating models to enhance organisational effectiveness.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gy4ydICWpol34Hxzjdhu4zdVshg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ZvAmdvgIGoKyiHxjBTiu68Kcs9d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional problem-solving skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to break down ambiguous business problems, identify the right data to validate hypotheses, and translate insights into practical, commercially sound recommendations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proficient at working with data &lt;/strong&gt;to identify opportunities, quantify business impact, evaluate performance, and support strategic decision-making.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong strategic thinking&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience developing business plans, evaluating growth opportunities, and influencing business decisions through structured analysis and clear communication.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication and storytelling skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to distil complex analyses into compelling presentations, business papers, and proposals for senior leadership, clients, and external stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record of operational execution&lt;/strong&gt;, demonstrating strong ownership and the ability to deliver measurable business outcomes in fast-paced environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Highly curious, adaptable, and intellectually rigorous&lt;/strong&gt;, with a bias towards action, a willingness to challenge assumptions, think from first principles, and continuously improve how work gets done.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience in management consulting, strategy, corporate development, or high-growth technology environments&lt;/strong&gt; is highly regarded. Experience in digital assets, fintech, or financial services is a plus.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CmqsdZ2GTo6Z9VxuHx4ugzRRsm3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt; Benefits &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
